---
import Page from '../../layouts/Page.astro';
import '../../styles/lab-simulator.css';
---

<Page
  title="PhoneFuturist Lab"
  description="Explore living virtual versions of unreleased devices and test how changing hardware assumptions changes the outcome."
>
  <div class="lab-page lab-home">
    <section class="lab-home-hero">
      <div class="lab-home-copy">
        <p class="lab-eyebrow">PhoneFuturist Lab · Public Beta</p>
        <h1>Use the phone<br /><span>before it exists.</span></h1>
        <p>
          PhoneFuturist builds a living virtual device from current evidence.
          Change the hardware, move a control and watch the consequences update live.
        </p>
        <div class="lab-home-actions">
          <a class="lab-cta" href="/interactive-leaks/simulate">Open Galaxy S27 Ultra →</a>
          <a class="lab-ghost" href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="lab-home-visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="lab-loop">
          <img src="/assets/phonefuturist-mark.svg" alt="" width="240" height="108" />
        </div>
        <div class="lab-readout lab-readout-a"><span>Power</span><strong>8.0 W</strong></div>
        <div class="lab-readout lab-readout-b"><span>Peak temp</span><strong>72.4°C</strong></div>
        <div class="lab-readout lab-readout-c"><span>Sustained</span><strong>94.2%</strong></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-demo">
      <div class="lab-demo-head">
        <div>
          <p class="lab-eyebrow">Living model</p>
          <h2>Touch one thing.<br /><span>Watch everything react.</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p>
          The default device is already built. You only change the assumptions
          you care about.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lab-module-preview">
        <div class="lab-module-copy">
          <span>SoC + thermals</span>
          <h3>Power target</h3>
          <div class="lab-fake-slider"><i style="width:58%"></i><b style="left:58%"></b></div>
          <div class="lab-scale"><span>4 W</span><strong>8.0 W</strong><span>14 W</span></div>

          <h3>Cooling strength</h3>
          <div class="lab-fake-slider"><i style="width:72%"></i><b style="left:72%"></b></div>
          <div class="lab-scale"><span>Low</span><strong>72%</strong><span>High</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="lab-module-result">
          <span class="lab-result-state">Thermally stable</span>
          <strong class="lab-result-temp">72.4°C</strong>
          <div class="lab-result-track"><i style="width:74%"></i></div>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Sustained</dt><dd>94.2%</dd></div>
            <div><dt>30 min power</dt><dd>8.1 W</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Throttle</dt><dd>None</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-how" id="how-it-works">
      <div class="lab-how-intro">
        <p class="lab-eyebrow">How it works</p>
        <h2>A simple surface.<br /><span>Serious machinery underneath.</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="lab-how-grid">
        <article><b>01</b><h3>Evidence builds the device.</h3><p>Current reports and historical hardware behavior define the starting model.</p></article>
        <article><b>02</b><h3>The engine runs locally.</h3><p>Supported controls update deterministic models immediately. No waiting for every slider move.</p></article>
        <article><b>03</b><h3>Every result stays replayable.</h3><p>Model versions and assumptions travel with the simulation so old runs remain reproducible.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Page>

<style>
  .lab-home { max-width: 1420px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .lab-home-hero { min-height: 650px; display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(360px,.95fr); gap:70px; align-items:center; padding:58px 0 84px; }
  .lab-home-copy h1 { margin:8px 0 24px; max-width:760px; font-size:clamp(4rem,8.5vw,8rem); line-height:.88; letter-spacing:-.075em; font-weight:620; }
  .lab-home-copy h1 span,.lab-demo-head h2 span,.lab-how-intro h2 span { color:#718092; }
  .lab-home-copy>p:not(.lab-eyebrow) { max-width:650px; color:var(--muted); font-size:1.03rem; line-height:1.75; }
  .lab-home-actions { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-top:30px; }
  .lab-home-visual { min-height:510px; position:relative; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid #1d2936; border-radius:28px; overflow:hidden; background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 42%,rgb(22 140 255/.16),transparent 35%),linear-gradient(155deg,#0e1620,#070b11); }
  .lab-home-visual::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; background-image:linear-gradient(rgb(255 255 255/.025) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgb(255 255 255/.025) 1px,transparent 1px); background-size:38px 38px; mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,#000,transparent 92%); }
  .lab-loop { width:300px; height:300px; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid rgb(44 217 255/.18); border-radius:50%; box-shadow:0 0 90px rgb(22 140 255/.08),inset 0 0 70px rgb(22 140 255/.05); z-index:1; }
  .lab-loop img { width:230px; filter:drop-shadow(0 0 24px rgb(22 140 255/.24)); }
  .lab-readout { position:absolute; z-index:2; min-width:124px; padding:11px 13px; border:1px solid #273646; border-radius:11px; background:rgb(8 13 20/.88); box-shadow:0 12px 34px rgb(0 0 0/.22); }
  .lab-readout span { display:block; margin-bottom:2px; color:#718092; font-size:.58rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.1em; }
  .lab-readout strong { font-size:.88rem; }
  .lab-readout-a{left:26px;top:68px}.lab-readout-b{right:24px;top:180px}.lab-readout-c{left:46px;bottom:58px}
  .lab-demo { padding:88px 0; border-top:1px solid #1d2936; }
  .lab-demo-head { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(280px,.45fr); gap:50px; align-items:end; margin-bottom:40px; }
  .lab-demo-head h2,.lab-how-intro h2 { margin:8px 0 0; font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,5.4rem); line-height:.95; letter-spacing:-.06em; font-weight:610; }
  .lab-demo-head>p { color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; }
  .lab-module-preview { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(340px,.7fr); gap:14px; }
  .lab-module-copy,.lab-module-result { padding:28px; border:1px solid #1f2b38; border-radius:18px; background:#0c131c; }
  .lab-module-copy>span,.lab-result-state { color:var(--cyan); font-size:.61rem; font-weight:750; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.12em; }
  .lab-module-copy h3 { margin:26px 0 10px; font-size:.84rem; font-weight:650; }
  .lab-fake-slider { height:8px; position:relative; border-radius:999px; background:#17222e; overflow:visible; }
  .lab-fake-slider i { display:block; height:100%; border-radius:inherit; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#168cff,#2cd9ff); }
  .lab-fake-slider b { position:absolute; top:50%; width:18px; height:18px; transform:translate(-50%,-50%); border:3px solid #eaf5ff; border-radius:50%; background:#168cff; box-shadow:0 0 18px rgb(22 140 255/.35); }
  .lab-scale { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; margin-top:9px; color:#657486; font-size:.64rem; }
  .lab-scale strong { color:#dce8f4; }
  .lab-module-result { display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; background:radial-gradient(circle at 90% 10%,rgb(22 140 255/.1),transparent 42%),#0c131c; }
  .lab-result-temp { margin:10px 0 20px; font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem); letter-spacing:-.07em; }
  .lab-result-track { height:9px; overflow:hidden; border-radius:999px; background:#17222e; }
  .lab-result-track i { display:block; width:74%; height:100%; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#168cff,#2cd9ff); }
  .lab-module-result dl { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:12px; margin:28px 0 0; }
  .lab-module-result dl div { padding-top:12px; border-top:1px solid #202c39; }
  .lab-module-result dt { color:#6f7e90; font-size:.59rem; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.08em; }
  .lab-module-result dd { margin:3px 0 0; font-size:.83rem; font-weight:650; }
  .lab-how { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.8fr) minmax(0,1.2fr); gap:70px; padding:90px 0 40px; border-top:1px solid #1d2936; }
  .lab-how-grid { display:grid; gap:0; }
  .lab-how-grid article { padding:24px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #1d2936; }
  .lab-how-grid b { color:#168cff; font-size:.64rem; }
  .lab-how-grid h3 { margin:8px 0 6px; font-size:1.2rem; }
  .lab-how-grid p { margin:0; color:var(--muted); line-height:1.7; }
  @media(max-width:900px){.lab-home-hero,.lab-demo-head,.lab-module-preview,.lab-how{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lab-home-visual{min-height:420px}.lab-demo-head{gap:20px}.lab-how{gap:30px}.lab-module-result dl{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr}}
  @media(max-width:620px){.lab-home-hero{padding-top:28px}.lab-home-copy h1{font-size:clamp(3.4rem,17vw,5.2rem)}.lab-home-visual{min-height:340px}.lab-loop{width:220px;height:220px}.lab-loop img{width:170px}.lab-readout{min-width:105px;padding:9px 10px}.lab-readout-a{left:12px;top:30px}.lab-readout-b{right:12px;top:140px}.lab-readout-c{left:22px;bottom:24px}.lab-module-copy,.lab-module-result{padding:20px}.lab-module-result dl{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lab-demo,.lab-how{padding-top:58px}}
</style>
